<title>ISRAEL: Electra Consumer Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Electra Consumer Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electra Consumer Products Ltd.</p>
<p>			 (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			 Q4 96     Q4 95	12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Sales		  164,741   243,094    1,152,005  1,158,982</p>
<p>Pretax profit  loss 30,921     6,271	 24,930     87,776</p>
<p>Net Profit	loss 7,423     7,186	 22,037     61,417</p>
<p>($1 = 3.25 shekels on Dec 31)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
